---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Services" description="AI strategy, AI privacy and compliance, and AI development from AIForgeWorx.">
  <section class="page-head">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>Services</h1>
      <p>Each service can stand alone or be part of one engagement.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <dl class="service-list">
        <div>
          <dt id="strategy">AI Strategy</dt>
          <dd>
            <p>Help deciding where AI should go first and what it will take to get there.</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Use-case discovery workshops with business and technology leads</li>
              <li>Data, systems and skills readiness assessments</li>
              <li>Build, buy or partner recommendations</li>
              <li>Business cases, phased roadmaps and success measures</li>
              <li>AI acceptable-use policies and staff guidance</li>
            </ul>
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt id="privacy-compliance">AI Privacy &amp; Compliance</dt>
          <dd>
            <p>The assessments, controls and documentation you need before AI goes live, and to keep it compliant afterwards.</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Privacy impact assessments for AI solutions</li>
              <li>AI risk assessments mapped to the NIST AI Risk Management Framework</li>
              <li>Governance frameworks aligned with ISO/IEC 42001</li>
              <li>Data residency, retention and access-control design</li>
              <li>Vendor and third-party AI tool reviews</li>
            </ul>
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt id="development">AI Development</dt>
          <dd>
            <p>AI solutions designed, built and tested in your environment, on the platforms you already use. We specialize in Microsoft Copilot Studio and Microsoft Foundry.</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Copilot Studio agents for Microsoft Teams, Microsoft 365 Copilot and the web</li>
              <li>Custom AI applications and agents built on Microsoft Foundry</li>
              <li>AI assistants and agents grounded in your own content</li>
              <li>Workflow automation that hands routine work to AI</li>
              <li>Integrations with your existing applications and data</li>
              <li>Testing, evaluation and monitoring for accuracy and safety</li>
              <li>Handover documentation and training for your team</li>
            </ul>
          </dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-band">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div>
        <h2>Not sure where to start?</h2>
        <p>Tell us what you’re trying to solve and we’ll suggest a first step.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="button button-primary" href="/contact/">Contact us</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
